{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/02/10/1498988/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2/9 BOMB 3月号発売！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ちゃんたくさん載ってます\n寺田・渡辺・中元の3人のページ\n是非見てみて下さいo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当、何度も言うようだけれど\n若い二人と並んで私大丈夫かしら......。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/02/10/1498988/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オトナひめたんo(^o^)oへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとブラックの衣装も着てます～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2/10 マーキー発売！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"永島、中田、堀、寺田、山崎、中元で\nアンダーライブ武道館の話や\nらりんの卒業の話など\nたっぷりインタビューしていただいてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、そう、これは急ぎの告知。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2/11 乃木坂46紅白SP！拡大版"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NHK BSプレミアムで放送。\n「大人への近道」スタジオライブ\n収録してきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日16:30～オンエアでございます。\nアンダーライブ武道館の様子も\nちょっと流れる......のかな？\nチェックよろしくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/02/10/1498988/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～お知らせ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2/9 ボム\n2/10 マーキー\n2/11 乃木坂46紅白SP！拡大版\n2/24 Samurai ELO\n2/29 ブブカ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に質問に答える！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/02/10/1498988/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはきいちゃんと\nどんな話をするのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ多かった(´,,•ω•,,｀)\nちなみに、賑やかそうだね～って\n結構言われたけど\nしっとり話してぐっすり寝たよ(´,,•ω•,,｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/02/10/1498988/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らじらーの時\n気をつけてることとかありますかー？\n(´,,•ω•,,｀)へへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/02/10/1498988/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"割っちゃった時、どう言う反応するの？\nめーるの話ですね。最近食器とか卵とか\n色んなものを地面に落として割るんですが、\nなんか、一回フリーズするよね......。\n我が家へお泊まり常連の愛未ちゃんにも\n「あんた最近割り過ぎよ～」と\n言われてしまった( ´ ･ω･ ` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/02/10/1498988/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれからデニム履く機会は増えた？\nデニムというか、\nパンツをいくつか買いました！\n私服ではパンツスタイルが多いかも最近！\n新しい扉を開いてくれて\nありがとうらじらー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2016/02/10/1498988/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛14thシングル制作期間中！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしててください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近のマイブームは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◯コールドプレスジュース\n◯ヒーリング音楽\n◯半身浴"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です！おやすみなさい～＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}